      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Tier 3 — Promotion Readiness",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Broader gate before promotion/merge to main - Includes all Tier 1 + Tier 2 (scoped) + additional coverage - Future `validate promotion-readiness` profile",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Additional checks beyond Tiers 1+2:** - Full pytest suite (except snapshots, network-dependent) - Snapshot tests (separate job, continue-on-error) - Dirty workspace check (`git status --porcelain`) - `uv sync --locked` (not just lock check) - Build check: `uv build` (dry-run)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Current CI coverage:** Full pytest (❌ not path-scoped), snapshot tests (✅ separate job). Build and dirty-workspace checks missing.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Tier 4 — Nightly / Manual Deep Audit",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Expensive or environment-sensitive checks - No PR blocking - Run on schedule or manual dispatch",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
