        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Migration from Current CI",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Keep as-is (healthy):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `ci.yml` pre-commit job — add schema validation and receipt emission tests to it - `ci.yml` snapshot-tests job — works as Tier 3 - `build-and-upload.yml` — healthy, stays as Tier 4 - `release.yml` — healthy, stays as manual - `issue-labeler.yml` — healthy, stays as operational",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Add (new gates):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Schema validation step to `ci.yml` pre-commit job - Schema Python contamination step to `ci.yml` pre-commit job - Tool receipt emission test step to `ci.yml` tests job - `uv lock --check` step to `ci.yml` pre-commit job - Path-aware domain-specific gates (Tier 2) as conditional jobs in `ci.yml`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-30",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Remove (stale):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `pylint.yml` — remove entire workflow - `python-package-conda.yml` — remove entire workflow",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Consider:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Restructure `ci.yml` from single `tests` job to path-filtered matrix jobs",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Cost Budget",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-35",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Tier",
        "Estimated CI cost per PR"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Tier 0 (local)",
          "0 CI minutes"
        ],
        [
          "Tier 1 (baseline)",
          "~1–2 minutes"
        ],
        [
          "Tier 2 (if triggered)",
          "~30s–2 minutes per triggered gate"
        ],
        [
          "Tier 3 (promotion)",
          "~5–10 minutes"
        ],
        [
          "Tier 4 (nightly)",
          "~20–30 minutes total"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Guard Against CI Overload",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Cap Tier 2 gates to 3 parallel jobs max** — avoid runner starvation 2. **Tier 1 must complete within 3 minutes** — if slower, split or optimize 3. **Network-dependent tests** (Google Drive, desktop) are never PR-blocking 4. **Snapshot tests are advisory only** — they use `continue-on-error` already 5. **Validate profiles should reuse CI gate definitions**, not duplicate them",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
